        "Each recitation is shown in Arabic with a reading aid and its meaning. Learn the correct pronunciation from a qualified reciter." to "Ana nuna kowane karatu da Larabci tare da taimakon karatu da ma'anarsa. Koyi ingantacciyar lafazin magana daga ƙwararren mai karantawa.",
