        "Keep about four fingers' space between the feet." to "Ajiye sararin yatsu kusan huɗu tsakanin ƙafafu.",
        "Niyyah (intention)" to "Niyyah (Niyya)",
        "Intend in your heart which prayer you are offering, for example ‘two rak‘at Fard of Fajr, for Allah’. Saying it with the tongue is recommended, not required." to "Ka yi niyya a zuciyarka wacce addu’ar da kake yi, misali ‘raka’at Fard Fajr, don Allah’. Fadin shi da harshe yana da shawarar, ba a buƙata ba.",
        "Also intend that you are following this imam." to "Kuma ku yi nufin kuna bin wannan liman.",
        "Takbir-e-Tahrimah" to "Takbir-e-Tahrimah",
        "Raise both hands until the thumbs touch the earlobes, palms facing the Qibla, and say Allahu Akbar. Then lower them and place the right hand over the left below the navel." to "Ka ɗaga hannaye biyu har sai manyan yatsan ya taɓa kunnuwa, dabino suna fuskantar alƙibla, sannan ka ce Allahu Akbar. Sa'an nan kuma sauke su kuma sanya hannun dama akan hagu a ƙasan cibiya.",
        "Raise both hands to the shoulders, keeping them inside the shawl, and say Allahu Akbar. Then place the right palm over the back of the left hand on the chest." to "Ka ɗaga hannayensu biyu zuwa kafaɗu, ka ajiye su a cikin shawl, sannan ka ce Allahu Akbar. Sannan sanya dabino na dama akan bayan hannun hagu akan kirji.",
